### List matches on a date (WIB)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/matches?date=14.09.2026

### Match detail
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/matches/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Live updates (Server-Sent Events); keep open
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/matches/stream
Accept: text/event-stream

### Leagues
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/leagues

### League with standings (season defaults to the latest)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/leagues/super-league

### Team page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teams/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Player page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/players/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Search teams, players, news
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/search?q=persib

### Asset (team logo / player photo) served from ASSETS_DIR
GET http://localhost:8080/assets/teams/IeUVbzhs.png
